            <description><![CDATA[<h2>FITS n' Finish 0.1.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>The app now detects on launch when it is running outside the Applications folder (e.g. straight from Downloads or a Gatekeeper-translocated path, where Sparkle cannot install updates) and offers to move itself to Applications and relaunch. Declining can be remembered; the moved copy has its quarantine cleared so it won&rsquo;t be translocated again.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
